# Frozen worker inputs for synthetic artifact tests

diagnostic-pilot-root-Cargo.lock is the exact Cargo.lock Git blob from worker
source 62114be0f5da3218706e30d7424acfb5d0579d07, 175300 bytes, SHA256
be46eaf8e97e507bda5e3f2b671d0d622e6a639ce1d4613769a4693723d62b19.
Its -text attribute preserves the original LF bytes on every platform.

This is not the workspace dependency lock and must not be regenerated by Cargo.
It supplies synthetic test contents for the existing immutable production pin;
no build provenance, installed executable or execution authority follows.
Tests need neither Git history nor network access at runtime. Source-contract
checks separately bind the committed bytes and unchanged old test assertions.
